    "Target Java 17+ as required by Spring Framework 6.0.",
    "Leverage Spring Batch's existing job composition features for U1 and U2.",
    "Use Spring Shell framework capabilities to implement tab completion for U6.",
    "Base Kafka integration investigation on Spring Kafka for U3.",
