    "Extract the Redis test fixtures into a standalone Spring configuration module for U8."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "The developer is highly experienced with the Spring ecosystem, including Spring Cloud Data Flow, Spring Batch, and Spring Cloud Stream.",
