    "Effort estimates include unit testing, integration testing, and basic documentation for each activity.",
    "No specific UI framework is mandated; standard web UI components will be used for the progress bar."
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "A1",
      "activity_name": "Implement Aggregated Progress Bar for Composed Jobs",
